<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 15.49 to 6804.79. For the week, the Dow fell 130.67 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.02 to 412.80.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.11.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1241 to 1154.</p>
<p>Volume was 534,371,130 compared with 496,861,340 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
